          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉગાડવું — ugāḍvũ — \"to grow plants\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે આંગણામાં ટામેટાં ઉગાડશો તો બજારમાંથી ખરીદવાં નહીં પડે. jo tame ā̃gṇāmā̃ ṭāmeṭā̃ ugāḍśo to bajārmā̃thī kharīdvā̃ nahī̃ paḍe. If you grow tomatoes in the courtyard, you will not have to buy them at the market."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે બગીચામાં ફૂલ ઉગાડ્યાં, teṇe bagīcāmā̃ phūl ugāḍyā̃."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉગાડવું (ugāḍvũ) is the causative of ઊગવું (ūgvũ), \"to rise, to sprout\", from a reconstructed udgāti, \"rises, comes forth\" (CDIAL 1954)."
            }
          ]
        },
